// Per-machine monitor layout for niri.
// Shared dotfiles keep this file mostly empty so every host can boot with
// automatic output placement. When you need fixed modes/scale/positions:
//
//   1. Log into niri
//   2. Run: niri msg outputs
//   3. Copy blocks from outputs.local.kdl.example below (or that file)
//   4. Keep machine-specific edits local (do not commit), OR add
//      hosts/<hostname>.kdl and symlink it to this file (see README)
//
// Example (commented):
//
// output "eDP-1" {
//     mode "1920x1080@60"
//     scale 1
// }
//
// output "HDMI-A-1" {
//     mode "2560x1440@60"
//     scale 1
//     position x=1920 y=0
// }
